# No co-authored commit trailers

**Never** add `Co-authored-by:` (or any co-author trailer) to commit messages in this repository.

## Agent rules

- Do not append co-author lines to commit messages or PR descriptions for attribution.
- After any commit, verify: `git cat-file commit HEAD | rg -i '^Co-authored-by:'` must return nothing.
- If `git commit` adds a co-author trailer anyway, rewrite with `git commit-tree` and a clean message, then `git reset --hard <new-sha>`.

## Commit messages

- One author only (the human repo owner).
- Clear subject + body; no tool attribution footers.
